  "summary": "I am a passionate and dedicated learner. It's for this reason I was drawn to coding. Finding out how things work conceptually and utilizing those tools in practical hands on applications is extremely engaging and rewarding for me.\n\nI have always had a passion for technology and a drive to explore new and unfamiliar things. Driven by this passion, I started learning and creating web applications. So far, I have successfully developed web applications using Pug Templates, Express, Sequelize, Flask, SQLAlchemy, React and Redux.\n\nFrom my time spent bartending in some of the fastest paced bars on the eastern coast, I have learned much about teamwork, clear and concise communication, and preforming well under pressure. When not engaging my mind and continuous thirst for knowledge, I spend my free time exploring the outdoors via backpacking, rafting/kayaking, and fishing.",
